<section class="copy-section" id="your-information-and-your-attorney" aria-labelledby="your-information-and-your-attorney-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="your-information-and-your-attorney-heading">Your information and your attorney</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>You remain present, approve material changes and control your credentials. Toza does not keep them for ongoing use, remotely control your devices, monitor them or install security software on them.</p>
<p>A family connection does not authorize work on someone else&apos;s account or device. Toza does not determine who is entitled to an account, document or asset. We do not investigate relatives, reconstruct past events forensically, collect evidence or give legal advice.</p>
<p>With your authorization, an attorney-friendly summary can describe the work and remaining issues. A referral does not automatically give counsel access to findings or personal information. The summary is not a forensic report or evidence document, and the work does not guarantee that every exposure is found or removed.</p>
<p><a href="/en/faq.html">Privacy and service boundaries</a> &#xB7; <a href="/en/attorneys.html">Information for attorneys</a></p>
